Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 04:12:47 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] ai-coding: add router dispatch mode

The controller runs in Claude Code, dispatches workers to Codex,
OpenCode or Claude Code tmux sessions through the workflow-core router,
and sleeps on a background `router.py wait` until a done, question,
stalled or exited message wakes it. Each task gets its own report
directory; dispatch success records pending-handoff, worker activity
records accepted. The other three modes, shared references and aliases
are unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
